Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:43.19,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7)}À beira do rio, no calor da multidão, fogos se desfazem no céu do oeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:48.15,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}Segurei a sua mão... pra gente não se separar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.79,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}Além dessa noite reluzente,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:09.38,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}quem me ensinou essa solidão de olhos marejados...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:14.47,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}foi você quem também me ensinou a sentir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:21.60,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}Uma única pétala de lírio-da-praia...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.43,0:01:27.31,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}Como se tentasse guardar até a dor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.06,0:01:31.03,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}continua cravada no meu peito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:38.03,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}Eu só pedia... que isso não acabasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.20,0:01:44.83,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}Você era a minha razão de viver.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:51.21,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}Nós dois olhávamos para um amanhã que não podíamos ver...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:02:00.72,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,20,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&HF166E0&\blur7}enquanto gravávamos no peito esse sonho de verão que se esvanece.
