Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:34.21,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}No caminho de volta para casa, sussurrei sem querer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:39.00,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}com uma voz que quase se perdia no som do vento.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.09,0:22:43.17,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Mesmo sem eu dizer o resto da frase,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:47.60,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}você me acolhe e compreende com todo carinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:51.77,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Às vezes faltam palavras
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:55.90,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}pra expressar direito o que eu sinto...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:23:00.03,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Mas, mesmo assim, a sua bondade
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:06.11,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}quase me faz chorar um pouco.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.11,0:23:10.41,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Eu nem cheguei a pedir nada...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:15.96,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}como você consegue notar sempre?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:20.92,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Gosto desse seu jeito de entender tudo de verdade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:26.18,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}sem nem precisar dizer "eu já sei".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.18,0:23:28.35,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Eu te amo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.51,0:23:32.56,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Como você sempre se lembrava das minhas coisas,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:38.98,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}hoje eu também consigo gostar de quem eu sou.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:45.11,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}A luz que a sua gentileza me deu...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:49.66,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}é como se colocasse um laço no meu coração.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.66,0:23:53.54,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}Agora é a minha vez,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.54,0:23:58.79,Toumei PTBR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,100)\blur10\bord7\3c&ffffff&\t(250,620, \3c&H0AA6D3&\blur7}então olha só pra mim aqui do seu lado.
